            <ArticleTitle>[Modern methods of the treatment of injured persons with combined vertebrospinal trauma].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>55-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>The issues of rehabilitational treatment of injured persons after polytrauma occurrence with compressive fracture of spine using electrostimulation were considered. The application of such an approach have had promoted the essential lowering of traumaticity and the treatment duration as well, the prognosis improvement, the length of temporary disability period reduction.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
